What you learned about them, in third person, as short plain lines under these four labels, leaving out any you know nothing about:
Who: name, where they are, life stage, work.
Context: routines, people who matter, what is going on right now.
Cares about: interests and values you noticed.
How to help: what they want from you, and how they like it.
Only what they actually said or clearly showed. No guesses, no flattery. Under 1000 characters.
